      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    weight_a = 0.40\n    weight_b = 0.60\n    variance_a = 0.04\n    variance_b = 0.09\n    covariance_ab = 0.02\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    portfolio_variance = (\n        (weight_a ** 2 * variance_a)\n        + (weight_b ** 2 * variance_b)\n        + (2 * weight_a * weight_b * covariance_ab)\n    )\n    answer = round(portfolio_variance, 4)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
